(838,1594,$mw$56916FEBFE7272B0A491DD9C2C9F05B860C818F8B8C9DA319B5443CBFC7C5E96$mw$,$mw$4ccadf50da691033fa09dfff895e8b1d$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1594,"StageId":1,"CategoryId":82,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"مزجنا 750 مل ماء مع 0.8 لتر عصير. كم مل يبلغ حجم الخليط؟","TitleEn":"We combine 750 mL water with 0.8 liters of juice. What is the total in mL?","QuestionTextAr":"مزجنا 750 مل ماء مع 0.8 لتر عصير. كم مل يبلغ حجم الخليط؟","QuestionTextEn":"We combine 750 mL water with 0.8 liters of juice. What is the total in mL?","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: عند جمع سعتين نوحّد الوحدات أولاً؛ 1 لتر = 1,000 مل. نحول 0.8 لتر إلى 0.8 × 1,000 = 800 مل. نجمع مع 750 مل ماء: 750 + 800 = 1,550 مل. المجموع يساوي 1.55 لتر، لكن المطلوب بالمليلتر.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Combine liquid volumes only after converting to a common unit; 1 litre = 1,000 mL. Convert 0.8 litres to 0.8 × 1,000 = 800 mL. Add 750 mL + 800 mL = 1,550 mL. Report millilitres as requested.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6365,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"1550","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6366,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"1500","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6367,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"830","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6368,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"1750","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"وحّد الوحدتين إلى ملليلتر.","En":"Convert both quantities to milliliters."},{"Ar":"حوّل حجم العصير ثم اجمع الحجمين.","En":"Convert the juice volume, then add both volumes."}],"Title":{"Ar":"مزجنا 750 مل ماء مع 0.8 لتر عصير. كم مل يبلغ حجم الخليط؟","En":"We combine 750 mL water with 0.8 liters of juice. What is the total in mL?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"1550","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"1500","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1500 يهمل 50 مل من المجموع.","En":"1500 omits 50 mL from the total."}},{"LatexCode":"830","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"830 يحول 0.8 لتر إلى 80 مل خطأً.","En":"830 incorrectly converts 0.8 liters to 80 mL."}},{"LatexCode":"1750","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1750 يفترض أن العصير لتر كامل.","En":"1750 assumes a full liter of juice."}}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"مزجنا 750 مل ماء مع 0.8 لتر عصير. كم مل يبلغ حجم الخليط؟","En":"We combine 750 mL water with 0.8 liters of juice. What is the total in mL?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نجمع الأحجام المقاسة بوحدة مشتركة.","En":"Add volumes measured in a common unit."},"Unit":{"Ar":"ملليلتر","En":"mL"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"في نموذج جمع الأحجام المدرسي نحول العصير إلى 800 ملليلتر.","En":"In the school additive-volume model, convert the juice to 800 milliliters."},{"Ar":"$0.8\\cdot1000=800$","En":"$0.8\\cdot1000=800$"},{"Ar":"نجمع الحجمين المعطيين بالوحدة نفسها.","En":"Add both given volumes in the same unit."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$1550$","En":"$1550$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستعمل عامل تحويل 100 بدلاً من 1000.","En":"Do not use a conversion factor of 100 instead of 1000."},"FormulaLatex":"1\\,\\mathrm L=1000\\,\\mathrm{mL}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$750+800=1550$","En":"$750+800=1550$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$1550-750=800$","En":"$1550-750=800$"}},"TrackIds":[5],"CategoryId":82,"PrimarySkillId":320,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"وحّد الوحدتين إلى ملليلتر.","En":"Convert both quantities to milliliters."},{"Ar":"حوّل حجم العصير ثم اجمع الحجمين.","En":"Convert the juice volume, then add both volumes."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نجمع الأحجام المقاسة بوحدة مشتركة.","En":"Add volumes measured in a common unit."},"Unit":{"Ar":"ملليلتر","En":"mL"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"في نموذج جمع الأحجام المدرسي نحول العصير إلى 800 ملليلتر.","En":"In the school additive-volume model, convert the juice to 800 milliliters."},{"Ar":"$0.8\\cdot1000=800$","En":"$0.8\\cdot1000=800$"},{"Ar":"نجمع الحجمين المعطيين بالوحدة نفسها.","En":"Add both given volumes in the same unit."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$1550$","En":"$1550$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستعمل عامل تحويل 100 بدلاً من 1000.","En":"Do not use a conversion factor of 100 instead of 1000."},"FormulaLatex":"1\\,\\mathrm L=1000\\,\\mathrm{mL}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$750+800=1550$","En":"$750+800=1550$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$1550-750=800$","En":"$1550-750=800$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1500 يهمل 50 مل من المجموع.","En":"1500 omits 50 mL from the total."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"830 يحول 0.8 لتر إلى 80 مل خطأً.","En":"830 incorrectly converts 0.8 liters to 80 mL."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1750 يفترض أن العصير لتر كامل.","En":"1750 assumes a full liter of juice."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$نجمع الأحجام المقاسة بوحدة مشتركة.

$1\,\mathrm L=1000\,\mathrm{mL}$

1. في نموذج جمع الأحجام المدرسي نحول العصير إلى 800 ملليلتر.

2. $0.8\cdot1000=800$

3. نجمع الحجمين المعطيين بالوحدة نفسها.

$750+800=1550$

$1550$ ملليلتر

$1550-750=800$

لا تستعمل عامل تحويل 100 بدلاً من 1000.$mw$,$mw$Add volumes measured in a common unit.

$1\,\mathrm L=1000\,\mathrm{mL}$

1. In the school additive-volume model, convert the juice to 800 milliliters.

2. $0.8\cdot1000=800$

3. Add both given volumes in the same unit.

$750+800=1550$

$1550$ mL

$1550-750=800$

Do not use a conversion factor of 100 instead of 1000.$mw$),
(839,1595,$mw$14E00CC743B892B9991D2363FF5FA451818EF2E2F26771BE7CCFF78E2C2C709D$mw$,$mw$c83b79fe3ab874ddb29f43032489dca9$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1595,"StageId":1,"CategoryId":82,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"غادر قطار الساعة 09:45 واستغرقت الرحلة ساعة و35 دقيقة. ما وقت الوصول؟","TitleEn":"A train leaves at 09:45 and travels for 1 hour 35 minutes. When does it arrive?","QuestionTextAr":"غادر قطار الساعة 09:45 واستغرقت الرحلة ساعة و35 دقيقة. ما وقت الوصول؟","QuestionTextEn":"A train leaves at 09:45 and travels for 1 hour 35 minutes. When does it arrive?","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: وقت الوصول = وقت المغادرة + مدة الرحلة، مع تحويل كل 60 دقيقة إلى ساعة. المغادرة 09:45 والمدة ساعة و35 دقيقة. نضيف ساعة أولاً فنصل إلى 10:45، ثم 35 دقيقة: 45 + 35 = 80 دقيقة، أي ساعة و20 دقيقة. لذلك وقت الوصول 11:20.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Arrival time = departure time + journey duration, carrying each full 60 minutes into an hour. Start at 09:45. Add one hour to get 10:45, then 35 minutes: 45 + 35 = 80 minutes, which carries one hour and leaves 20 minutes. Arrival is 11:20.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6369,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"\\text{10:20}","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6370,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"\\text{11:10}","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6371,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"\\text{11:20}","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6372,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"\\text{11:40}","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"أضف الساعات والدقائق بالتتابع.","En":"Add hours and minutes in sequence."},{"Ar":"عندما يصل مجموع الدقائق إلى 60، انقل ساعة واحسب الباقي.","En":"When minutes reach 60, carry an hour and keep the remainder."}],"Title":{"Ar":"غادر قطار الساعة 09:45 واستغرقت الرحلة ساعة و35 دقيقة. ما وقت الوصول؟","En":"A train leaves at 09:45 and travels for 1 hour 35 minutes. When does it arrive?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"\\text{10:20}","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"10:20 يهمل ساعة كاملة من مدة الرحلة.","En":"10:20 omits one full hour of the journey."}},{"LatexCode":"\\text{11:10}","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"11:10 ينقص عشر دقائق من المدة.","En":"11:10 is ten minutes short."}},{"LatexCode":"\\text{11:20}","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"\\text{11:40}","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"11:40 يزيد عشرين دقيقة على المدة.","En":"11:40 adds twenty extra minutes."}}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"غادر قطار الساعة 09:45 واستغرقت الرحلة ساعة و35 دقيقة. ما وقت الوصول؟","En":"A train leaves at 09:45 and travels for 1 hour 35 minutes. When does it arrive?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"لحساب وقت الوصول نضيف مدة الرحلة إلى وقت المغادرة؛ الساعة 60 دقيقة.","En":"Arrival time is departure plus duration; an hour is 60 minutes."},"Unit":{"Ar":"وقت الوصول","En":"arrival time"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نضيف ساعة إلى 09:45 فنحصل على 10:45.","En":"Add one hour to 09:45 to obtain 10:45."},{"Ar":"$9\\cdot60+45+60+35=680$","En":"$9\\cdot60+45+60+35=680$"},{"Ar":"نضيف 15 دقيقة للوصول إلى 11:00 ثم 20 دقيقة متبقية.","En":"Add 15 minutes to reach 11:00, then the remaining 20 minutes."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\text{11:20}$","En":"$\\text{11:20}$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعامل الساعة كأنها 100 دقيقة.","En":"Do not treat an hour as 100 minutes."},"FormulaLatex":"60\\,\\mathrm{min}=1\\,\\mathrm h","Substitution":{"Ar":"$680=11\\cdot60+20$","En":"$680=11\\cdot60+20$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$680-585=95=60+35$","En":"$680-585=95=60+35$"}},"TrackIds":[4],"CategoryId":82,"PrimarySkillId":324,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"أضف الساعات والدقائق بالتتابع.","En":"Add hours and minutes in sequence."},{"Ar":"عندما يصل مجموع الدقائق إلى 60، انقل ساعة واحسب الباقي.","En":"When minutes reach 60, carry an hour and keep the remainder."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"لحساب وقت الوصول نضيف مدة الرحلة إلى وقت المغادرة؛ الساعة 60 دقيقة.","En":"Arrival time is departure plus duration; an hour is 60 minutes."},"Unit":{"Ar":"وقت الوصول","En":"arrival time"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نضيف ساعة إلى 09:45 فنحصل على 10:45.","En":"Add one hour to 09:45 to obtain 10:45."},{"Ar":"$9\\cdot60+45+60+35=680$","En":"$9\\cdot60+45+60+35=680$"},{"Ar":"نضيف 15 دقيقة للوصول إلى 11:00 ثم 20 دقيقة متبقية.","En":"Add 15 minutes to reach 11:00, then the remaining 20 minutes."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\text{11:20}$","En":"$\\text{11:20}$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعامل الساعة كأنها 100 دقيقة.","En":"Do not treat an hour as 100 minutes."},"FormulaLatex":"60\\,\\mathrm{min}=1\\,\\mathrm h","Substitution":{"Ar":"$680=11\\cdot60+20$","En":"$680=11\\cdot60+20$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$680-585=95=60+35$","En":"$680-585=95=60+35$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"10:20 يهمل ساعة كاملة من مدة الرحلة.","En":"10:20 omits one full hour of the journey."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"11:10 ينقص عشر دقائق من المدة.","En":"11:10 is ten minutes short."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"11:40 يزيد عشرين دقيقة على المدة.","En":"11:40 adds twenty extra minutes."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$لحساب وقت الوصول نضيف مدة الرحلة إلى وقت المغادرة؛ الساعة 60 دقيقة.

$60\,\mathrm{min}=1\,\mathrm h$

1. نضيف ساعة إلى 09:45 فنحصل على 10:45.

2. $9\cdot60+45+60+35=680$

3. نضيف 15 دقيقة للوصول إلى 11:00 ثم 20 دقيقة متبقية.

$680=11\cdot60+20$

$\text{11:20}$ وقت الوصول

$680-585=95=60+35$

لا تعامل الساعة كأنها 100 دقيقة.$mw$,$mw$Arrival time is departure plus duration; an hour is 60 minutes.

$60\,\mathrm{min}=1\,\mathrm h$

1. Add one hour to 09:45 to obtain 10:45.

2. $9\cdot60+45+60+35=680$

3. Add 15 minutes to reach 11:00, then the remaining 20 minutes.

$680=11\cdot60+20$

$\text{11:20}$ arrival time

$680-585=95=60+35$

Do not treat an hour as 100 minutes.$mw$),
(840,1596,$mw$CB461A25140766428E6F5403FF14214434F93697B7231AE97A8EF01FE52729B3$mw$,$mw$bc9f14930085f4415fb08da487e78974$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1596,"StageId":1,"CategoryId":82,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"بدأ نشاط الساعة 14:10 وانتهى الساعة 15:05. كم دقيقة استمر؟","TitleEn":"An activity starts at 14:10 and ends at 15:05. How many minutes does it last?","QuestionTextAr":"بدأ نشاط الساعة 14:10 وانتهى الساعة 15:05. كم دقيقة استمر؟","QuestionTextEn":"An activity starts at 14:10 and ends at 15:05. How many minutes does it last?","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: مدة النشاط = وقت النهاية − وقت البداية. النشاط من 14:10 حتى 15:05؛ نحسب من 14:10 إلى 15:00 = 50 دقيقة، ثم من 15:00 إلى 15:05 = 5 دقائق. المجموع = 50 + 5 = 55 دقيقة. نراعي انتقال الساعة بدلاً من طرح الدقائق فقط.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Duration = finishing time − starting time. From 14:10 to 15:00 is 50 minutes, and from 15:00 to 15:05 is another 5 minutes. Add 50 + 5 = 55 minutes. This correctly handles the hour boundary.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6373,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"45","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6374,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"50","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6375,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"65","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6376,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"55","IsCorrect":true}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"جزّئ الفترة عند الساعة التالية.","En":"Split the interval at the next full hour."},{"Ar":"احسب الزمن حتى الساعة 15:00 ثم أضف الدقائق المتبقية.","En":"Count the minutes to 15:00, then add the remaining minutes."}],"Title":{"Ar":"بدأ نشاط الساعة 14:10 وانتهى الساعة 15:05. كم دقيقة استمر؟","En":"An activity starts at 14:10 and ends at 15:05. How many minutes does it last?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"45","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"45 يطرح خمس دقائق بدلاً من إضافتها إلى 50.","En":"Forty-five subtracts five instead of adding it to fifty."}},{"LatexCode":"50","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"50 يتوقف عند 15:00.","En":"Fifty stops at 15:00."}},{"LatexCode":"65","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"65 لا يساوي مدة الفترة المحددة.","En":"Sixty-five is not the given interval duration."}},{"LatexCode":"55","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"بدأ نشاط الساعة 14:10 وانتهى الساعة 15:05. كم دقيقة استمر؟","En":"An activity starts at 14:10 and ends at 15:05. How many minutes does it last?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المدة هي الفرق بين وقت النهاية والبداية بعد توحيد الوحدة.","En":"Duration is the difference between ending and starting times in a common unit."},"Unit":{"Ar":"دقيقة","En":"minutes"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"من 14:10 إلى 15:00 خمسون دقيقة.","En":"From 14:10 to 15:00 is fifty minutes."},{"Ar":"$(15\\cdot60+5)-(14\\cdot60+10)$","En":"$(15\\cdot60+5)-(14\\cdot60+10)$"},{"Ar":"نضيف خمس دقائق للوصول إلى 15:05.","En":"Add five minutes to reach 15:05."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$55$","En":"$55$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تطرح الدقائق منفصلة دون حساب عبور الساعة.","En":"Do not subtract minute digits without accounting for the hour boundary."},"FormulaLatex":"D=t_2-t_1","Substitution":{"Ar":"$905-850=55$","En":"$905-850=55$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$50+5=55$","En":"$50+5=55$"}},"TrackIds":[3],"CategoryId":82,"PrimarySkillId":324,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"جزّئ الفترة عند الساعة التالية.","En":"Split the interval at the next full hour."},{"Ar":"احسب الزمن حتى الساعة 15:00 ثم أضف الدقائق المتبقية.","En":"Count the minutes to 15:00, then add the remaining minutes."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المدة هي الفرق بين وقت النهاية والبداية بعد توحيد الوحدة.","En":"Duration is the difference between ending and starting times in a common unit."},"Unit":{"Ar":"دقيقة","En":"minutes"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"من 14:10 إلى 15:00 خمسون دقيقة.","En":"From 14:10 to 15:00 is fifty minutes."},{"Ar":"$(15\\cdot60+5)-(14\\cdot60+10)$","En":"$(15\\cdot60+5)-(14\\cdot60+10)$"},{"Ar":"نضيف خمس دقائق للوصول إلى 15:05.","En":"Add five minutes to reach 15:05."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$55$","En":"$55$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تطرح الدقائق منفصلة دون حساب عبور الساعة.","En":"Do not subtract minute digits without accounting for the hour boundary."},"FormulaLatex":"D=t_2-t_1","Substitution":{"Ar":"$905-850=55$","En":"$905-850=55$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$50+5=55$","En":"$50+5=55$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"45 يطرح خمس دقائق بدلاً من إضافتها إلى 50.","En":"Forty-five subtracts five instead of adding it to fifty."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"50 يتوقف عند 15:00.","En":"Fifty stops at 15:00."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"65 لا يساوي مدة الفترة المحددة.","En":"Sixty-five is not the given interval duration."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$المدة هي الفرق بين وقت النهاية والبداية بعد توحيد الوحدة.

$D=t_2-t_1$

1. من 14:10 إلى 15:00 خمسون دقيقة.

2. $(15\cdot60+5)-(14\cdot60+10)$

3. نضيف خمس دقائق للوصول إلى 15:05.

$905-850=55$

$55$ دقيقة

$50+5=55$

لا تطرح الدقائق منفصلة دون حساب عبور الساعة.$mw$,$mw$Duration is the difference between ending and starting times in a common unit.

$D=t_2-t_1$

1. From 14:10 to 15:00 is fifty minutes.

2. $(15\cdot60+5)-(14\cdot60+10)$

3. Add five minutes to reach 15:05.

$905-850=55$

$55$ minutes

$50+5=55$

Do not subtract minute digits without accounting for the hour boundary.$mw$),
